      "content": "Wait, what? I'm not sure I follow the \"amulets\" and \"spells\" thing. I'm looking for a professional technical guide for a law firm, not a fantasy concept. Can you just stick to the actual technical steps for the configuration and onboarding? I need to present this to the senior partners so they understand the security benefits.",
