    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "My apologies for the confusion. Let's get straight to the technical steps for deploying YubiKeys and onboarding your partners without the goblin metaphors.\n\nStep 1: Acquiring YubiKeys\n- Purchase YubiKeys from a reputable vendor, ensuring compatibility with your firm's existing systems.\n- Order a sufficient quantity of YubiKeys to cover all partners and staff.\n\nStep 2: Distributing YubiKeys\n- Assign each YubiKey to a specific user, ensuring that each key is unique to prevent unauthorized access.\n- Provide each user with their YubiKey and any necessary documentation for setup.\n\nStep 3: Installing YubiKey Drivers and Software\n- Guide users through the installation of YubiKey drivers and any required software on their devices.\n- Verify that the drivers are compatible with the operating systems in use by your firm's partners.\n\nStep 4: Configuring YubiKeys with Your Security Systems\n- Integrate YubiKeys with your firm's authentication systems, such as your VPN or email servers.\n- Configure the YubiKeys to work with your existing multi-factor authentication (MFA) setup.\n\nStep 5: Testing YubiKeys\n- Conduct thorough testing to ensure that each YubiKey functions correctly with your firm's systems",
